            <ArticleTitle>Giant Intradiploic Epidermoid Cyst.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>362-363</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A giant intradiploic epidermoid cyst was seen in a 13 year old male manifesting as a swelling in the right sub-temporal region along with proptosis of the right eye for the last 6 years. There was no intracranial extension of the cyst. Removal of the cyst was followed by complete recovery of the proptosis of the eye.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
